1044
00:40:06,264 --> 00:40:07,624
Master told me to ignore you,

1045
00:40:07,825 --> 00:40:09,104
and never mention this

1046
00:40:09,104 --> 00:40:09,985
to Tian's wife.

1047
00:40:10,345 --> 00:40:12,184
Otherwise,
your dad's condition will worsen.

1048
00:40:12,544 --> 00:40:13,305
Dad is sick,

1049
00:40:13,425 --> 00:40:14,425
and a doctor can help,

1050
00:40:14,505 --> 00:40:15,264
not some master.

1051
00:40:15,305 --> 00:40:16,425
Stop being so superstitious.

1052
00:40:16,704 --> 00:40:18,345
But the doctors haven't helped either.

1053
00:40:18,865 --> 00:40:20,305
I have to try something,

1054
00:40:20,425 --> 00:40:20,985
